<Layout title="About CookMushroom | CookMushroom" description="CookMushroom is a practical mushroom cooking reference focused on cook times, methods, and simple recipes.">
  <main class="guide">
    <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
    <h1>About CookMushroom</h1>
    <article class="prose">
      <p>CookMushroom is a focused cooking reference: how long mushrooms take, how to brown them, and what to make with them.</p>
      <p>We keep the site narrow on purpose. It covers cooking edible mushrooms, not wild mushroom identification or medical claims.</p>
      <p>Start with the <a href="/mushroom-cook-time-chart/">cook-time chart</a> or browse the <a href="/guides/">guides</a>.</p>
    </article>
  </main>
</Layout>
